---
// WhatsApp PHI 管控声明（HIPAA G1 整改）
// 全站凡引导使用 WhatsApp 联系处，均引用此组件，统一声明：
//   WhatsApp 由 Meta 运营，不签署 HIPAA BAA；
//   仅用于一般性联系与预约，严禁经此渠道传输任何受保护健康信息（PHI）。
import { getLocaleFromPath } from '../i18n';
const locale = getLocaleFromPath(Astro.url.pathname);
const ZH = locale === 'zh-hant';
---

<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed flex items-start gap-2" style="color: var(--color-stone-400);">
  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="color: var(--color-gold-500);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"/>
  </svg>
  <span>
    {ZH
      ? '免責聲明：WhatsApp 由 Meta 運營，未簽署 HIPAA 商務夥伴協議（BAA）。本渠道僅供一般諮詢與預約，請勿經此傳送任何病歷、診斷或治療相關的受保護健康資訊（PHI）。涉及個人醫療資訊，請使用安全的 eIVF 病人專區或致電診所總機。'
      : 'Disclaimer: WhatsApp is operated by Meta and is not covered by a HIPAA Business Associate Agreement (BAA). It is for general inquiries and scheduling only — do not send any protected health information (PHI) such as medical history, diagnoses, or treatment details here. For personal health information, use the secure eIVF patient portal or call the clinic main line.'}
  </span>
</p>
